    "title": "Saint of the Day (June 28): St. Irenaeus of Lyon — First Great Theologian Against Gnosticism",
    "metaDescription": "Saint of the Day June 28: St. Irenaeus of Lyon — First Great Theologian Against Gnosticism. Patron of Apologetics, Gaul, bishops, and catechists....",
