    "title": "Saint of the Day (July 31): St. Ignatius of Loyola — Founder of the Jesuits and Author of the Spiritual Exercises",
    "metaDescription": "Saint of the Day July 31: St. Ignatius of Loyola — Founder of the Jesuits and Author of the Spiritual Exercises. Patron of retreats, Jesuits, soldiers,...",
    "excerpt": "St. Ignatius of Loyola (July 31) — Founder of the Jesuits and Author of the Spiritual Exercises. Patron of retreats. Founder of the Society of Jesus (Jesuits)",
